ople, places and skills to resolve it, choosing whether to fight, sneak, bargain or talk your way through. Your decisions change how the story unfolds and which ending you reach.\n\nIt is a single-player game with a thoughtful pace, mixing puzzle-like card choices with narrative. There is no deckbuilding grind; the focus stays on the story and the many ways to solve each scene. Foretales suits players who like card games and fairy-tale storytelling."}}